pe: Institution of higher education\nCategory: Universities\nCountry: Egypt\nCity: Cairo\nOfficial Description: Located in Cairo, in the heart of the Middle East, AUC is a leading English-language, American-accredited institution of higher education and center of intellectual, social and cultural life of the Arab world.', 'extract_links': False, 'extract_images': False, 'start_from_char': 0, 'already_collected': []}, 'interacted_element': None}, {'click': {'index': 5885}, 'interacted_element': DOMInteractedElement(node_id=610, backend_node_id=5885, frame_id=None, node_type=<NodeType.ELEMENT_NODE: 1>, node_value='', node_name='A', attributes={'href': '/about/mission-and-history', 'class': 'hero-homepage__link'}, bounds=DOMRect(x=100.0, y=930.015625, width=302.78125, height=18.0), x_path='html/body/div/div[2]/section/div/ul/li/a', element_hash=3024424841779898894, stable_hash=3024424841779898894, ax_name='AUC Mission, Vision and History')}, {'extract': {'query': 'Mission: The American University in Cairo is a premier English-language institution of higher learning. The University is committed to teaching and research of the highest caliber, and offers exceptional liberal arts and professional education in a cross-cultural environment. AUC builds a culture of leadership, lifelong learning, continuing education and service among its graduates, and is dedicated to making significant contributions to Egypt and the international community in diverse fields. AUC upholds the principles of academic freedom and is dedicated to excellence.\nVision: Our vision is to be a world‐class University internationally recognized for its leadership and excellence in teaching, research, creative expression and service. We build on our existing strengths to become the leading University in the Middle East and the destination of choice for students and faculty members from around the world seeking in‐depth cultural exposure, combined with outstanding academic programs, cutting‐edge research, as well as an ethically engaged, diverse community of scholars.', 'extract_links': False, 'extract_images': False, 'start_from_char': 0, 'already_collected': []}, 'interacted_element': None}, {'scroll': {'down': True, 'pages': 1.0}, 'interacted_element': None}, {'scroll': {'down': True, 'pages': 1.0}, 'interacted_element': None}, {'click': {'index': 8505}, 'interacted_element': DOMInteractedElement(node_id=3004, backend_node_id=8505, frame_id=None, node_type=<NodeType.ELEMENT_NODE: 1>, node_value='', node_name='A', attributes={'class': 'sidebar__link  ', 'href': '/about/facts-and-figures'}, bounds=DOMRect(x=366.0, y=2202.328125, width=129.625, height=22.84375), x_path='html/body/div[1]/div[2]/div/aside/div/div/section/div/nav/ul/li[4]/a', element_hash=8910492488150275259, stable_hash=1141824787038767826, ax_name='Facts and Figures')}, {'click': {'index': 11082}, 'interacted_element': DOMInteractedElement(node_id=622, backend_node_id=11082, frame_id=None, node_type=<NodeType.ELEMENT_NODE: 1>, node_value='', node_name='A', attributes={'class': 'btn-primary', 'href': 'https://www.aucegypt.edu/about/auc-profile-and-fact-book'}, bounds=DOMRect(x=366.0, y=590.9375, width=416.21875, height=45.953125), x_path='html/body/div[1]/main/div[1]/div/div/p[2]/a', element_hash=888517290502802162, stable_hash=17029418354998659819, ax_name='Check the latest AUC Profile and Factbook')}, {'click': {'index': 13769}, 'interacted_element': DOMInteractedElement(node_id=679, backend_node_id=13769, frame_id=None, node_type=<NodeType.ELEMENT_NODE: 1>, node_value='', node_name='A', attributes={'href': 'https://aucegypt0.sharepoint.com/:b:/s/documents/IQBGIeZhihbyQJw7lBIcyYCTAdn_xnXPjXMXXGLzFDjmx8c?e=megGfz'}, bounds=DOMRect(x=698.5, y=344.984375, width=154.0, height=24.0), x_path='html/body/div[1]/div[2]/div/main/div[1]/div/table/tbody/tr/td[1]/ul/li[1]/a', element_hash=479686188562961753, stable_hash=14314744243845125459, ax_name='Profile 2025-2026')}, {'wait': {'seconds': 5}, 'interacted_ele